<view class="page"><view class="row"><text class="kicker">DAILY RITUAL / 01</text><text class="date">{{date}}</text></view><text class="title">把心愿，放在眼前。</text><text class="subtitle">一幅画，一件小事，一点向前的力量。</text><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在载入今日内容…</view><view class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view>
<view class="artwork {{status.displayPlan.contentMode==='photo'?'photo':''}}"><image wx:if="{{image}}" src="{{image}}" mode="aspectFit" class="painting"/><view wx:elif="{{!sample}}" class="blank">还没有选择画面<text class="note">先在画屏页选择照片或已有祈福图。</text></view><view class="art-title" wx:if="{{sample||status.displayPlan.contentMode!=='photo'}}">今日祈愿</view><view class="seal" wx:if="{{sample||status.displayPlan.contentMode!=='photo'}}">愿</view><view class="art-action" wx:if="{{sample||status.action}}"><text class="action-label">{{sample?'此刻 · 一件小事':status.action.branch+'时 · '+status.action.title}}</text><text class="action-text">{{sample?'放松肩膀，慢慢呼吸片刻':status.action.text}}</text></view></view>
<view class="row"><text class="badge">{{sample?'示例画面':status.displaySource==='device_report'?'设备最近回报':'计划预览'}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新内容</button></view><view wx:if="{{sample}}" class="notice">这是一张示例画。登录后，查看你的照片、祈福画和展示计划。</view><view wx:elif="{{status.syncConfigured===false}}" class="notice">内容保存在账户中。设备下发服务尚未接入，目前不会自动发送到画屏。</view><text wx:if="{{status.deviceReport.lastSeen}}" class="note">设备最近联网：{{status.deviceReport.lastSeen}}</text><text wx:if="{{status.notice}}" class="note">{{status.notice}}</text>
<view class="paper" wx:if="{{status.action}}"><text class="kicker">此刻的微行动</text><text class="section-title">{{status.action.title}}</text><text>{{status.action.detail}}</text><text class="note">通用动作建议 · 请以身体舒适为准</text></view>
<view class="paper" wx:if="{{status.artwork}}"><button class="text-button" bindtap="expand">{{expanded?'收起':'展开'}} · {{status.displayPlan.contentMode==='photo'?'照片说明':'画面解读'}}</button><view wx:if="{{expanded}}"><text>{{intro}}</text><view wx:for="{{readings}}" wx:key="title" class="spaced"><text class="section-title">{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.body}}</text></view></view></view><view class="stack spaced"><button class="primary" bindtap="open">{{sample?'登录，开启我的画屏':'管理我的画屏'}}</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="answers">翻开答案之书</button></view></view>
